          "text_version": "s3v3-e66447753f4bd992fa3a72b3ef60e37e",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 142,
          "exact_quote": "highly atypical cells with eosinophilic cytoplasm, increased nuclear-to-cytoplasmic ratio, poor cellular cohesion, and sarcomatoid morphology.",
