          "start": 0,
          "end": 144,
          "exact_quote": "×400; scale bar, 50 mm). (B) Immunohistochemical staining for synaptophysin (SYN) showing a heterogeneous pattern. The right region of the image",
          "occurrence": 0,
          "physical_page": 4,
          "bbox": [
            60.830100019999975,
